{"title":"Career Roadmap · Unani Physician","role":"Unani Physician","summary":"A Unani Physician is a healthcare professional trained in the Unani system of medicine, with education covering traditional Unani medical theory, diagnosis, pharmacology, therapeutics, preventive medicine and clinical practice.","facts":{"Current degree":"BUMS (Unani)","Course":"Unani Medicine & Surgery"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Unani Physician is a healthcare professional trained in the Unani system of medicine, with education covering traditional Unani medical theory, diagnosis, pharmacology, therapeutics, preventive medicine and clinical practice."},{"type":"h","text":"The role can involve:"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient history and clinical assessment"},{"type":"h","text":"Unani-based diagnosis and treatment planning"},{"type":"h","text":"Prescription and supervision of Unani medicines"},{"type":"h","text":"Preventive and lifestyle-oriented healthcare"},{"type":"h","text":"Regimental therapies where appropriately trained"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient counselling and follow-up"},{"type":"h","text":"Community and public-health activities"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical documentation and research"},{"type":"p","text":"In India, professional practice requires completion of a recognized BUMS program, the required internship, and applicable professional registration under the current regulatory framework. Exact registration and scope-of-practice requirements should always be verified against the latest applicable official rules."}]},{"heading":"Career Pathway","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Class 12 — PCB"},{"type":"h","text":"NEET-UG"},{"type":"h","text":"BUMS"},{"type":"flow","items":["Pre-clinical","Para-clinical","Unani clinical education"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Compulsory Internship"},{"type":"h","text":"Applicable Professional Registration"},{"type":"h","text":"Unani Physician / Medical Officer"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Experience"},{"type":"h","text":"┌──────────────────────────────┐"},{"type":"h","text":"│ General Unani Practice │"},{"type":"h","text":"│ Government Healthcare │"},{"type":"h","text":"│ Private Hospital/Clinic │"},{"type":"h","text":"│ Unani Pharmacy/Industry │"},{"type":"h","text":"│ Research & Academics │"},{"type":"h","text":"│ Wellness & Preventive Care │"},{"type":"h","text":"└──────────────────────────────┘"},{"type":"h","text":"PG / Specialization"},{"type":"h","text":"Specialist / Senior Physician /"},{"type":"h","text":"Academic / Researcher / Consultant"}]},{"heading":"BUMS Learning Roadmap","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Foundations of Medicine"},{"type":"h","text":"Core Areas"},{"type":"h","text":"Anatomy"},{"type":"h","text":"Physiology"},{"type":"h","text":"Biochemistry"},{"type":"h","text":"Unani principles and philosophy"},{"type":"h","text":"Arabic and terminology"},{"type":"h","text":"History of medicine"},{"type":"h","text":"Basic medical terminology"},{"type":"h","text":"Skills to Develop"},{"type":"h","text":"Human anatomy understanding"},{"type":"h","text":"Physiological reasoning"},{"type":"h","text":"Medical terminology"},{"type":"h","text":"Basic laboratory interpretation"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient communication"},{"type":"h","text":"Medical ethics"},{"type":"h","text":"Scientific reading"},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Activities"},{"type":"h","text":"Anatomy practicals"},{"type":"h","text":"Physiology experiments"},{"type":"h","text":"Medical terminology exercises"},{"type":"h","text":"Basic clinical observation"},{"type":"h","text":"Introduction to medical literature"}]},{"heading":"Year 2 — Disease & Diagnostic Foundations","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Students begin connecting fundamental sciences with disease processes and clinical diagnosis."},{"type":"h","text":"Core Areas"},{"type":"h","text":"Pathology"},{"type":"h","text":"Microbiology"},{"type":"h","text":"Pharmacology"},{"type":"h","text":"Forensic medicine"},{"type":"h","text":"Community medicine"},{"type":"h","text":"Unani pharmacology"},{"type":"h","text":"Unani materia medica"},{"type":"h","text":"Skills"},{"type":"h","text":"Understanding disease mechanisms"},{"type":"h","text":"Basic laboratory interpretation"},{"type":"h","text":"Pharmacological reasoning"},{"type":"h","text":"Medicine safety"},{"type":"h","text":"Infection-control principles"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical documentation"},{"type":"h","text":"Public-health awareness"},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Unani Clinical Medicine"},{"type":"p","text":"The emphasis increasingly moves toward clinical diagnosis and management."},{"type":"h","text":"Important Areas"},{"type":"h","text":"Unani medicine"},{"type":"h","text":"Ilmul Advia / pharmacology"},{"type":"h","text":"Mahiyatul Amraz / pathology"},{"type":"h","text":"Tahaffuzi wa Samaji Tib"},{"type":"h","text":"Ilmul Saidla / pharmacy"},{"type":"h","text":"Regimental therapy"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical examination"},{"type":"h","text":"Students should learn to integrate:"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient History"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Examination"},{"type":"h","text":"Unani Clinical Assessment"},{"type":"h","text":"Differential Understanding"},{"type":"h","text":"Investigations where appropriate"},{"type":"h","text":"Treatment Planning"},{"type":"h","text":"Medicine / Regimen"},{"type":"h","text":"Follow-up"}]},{"heading":"Final Year — Advanced Clinical Practice","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Major Clinical Exposure"},{"type":"p","text":"Depending on the curriculum and institution, exposure may include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Medicine"},{"type":"h","text":"Surgery"},{"type":"h","text":"Gynecology and obstetrics"},{"type":"h","text":"Pediatrics"},{"type":"h","text":"Ophthalmology"},{"type":"h","text":"ENT"},{"type":"h","text":"Dermatology"},{"type":"h","text":"Preventive medicine"},{"type":"h","text":