xamination"},{"type":"h","text":"Systemic examination"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical reasoning"},{"type":"h","text":"Differential diagnosis"},{"type":"h","text":"Basic interpretation of investigations"},{"type":"h","text":"Treatment planning"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient monitoring"},{"type":"h","text":"Referral decision-making"},{"type":"h","text":"Follow-up management"},{"type":"h","text":"Unani Skills"},{"type":"h","text":"Principles of Unani medicine"},{"type":"h","text":"Mizaj assessment"},{"type":"h","text":"Akhlat concepts"},{"type":"h","text":"Unani pathology"},{"type":"h","text":"Unani pharmacology"},{"type":"h","text":"Materia medica"},{"type":"h","text":"Ilaj-bit-Tadbeer / regimental therapy"},{"type":"h","text":"Diet and lifestyle guidance"},{"type":"h","text":"Preventive healthcare"},{"type":"h","text":"Unani formulations"},{"type":"h","text":"Modern Healthcare Skills"},{"type":"p","text":"A modern Unani physician should also understand:"},{"type":"h","text":"Basic pathology"},{"type":"h","text":"Microbiology"},{"type":"h","text":"Pharmacology"},{"type":"h","text":"Laboratory investigations"},{"type":"h","text":"Medical imaging reports"},{"type":"h","text":"Infection prevention"},{"type":"h","text":"Emergency recognition"},{"type":"h","text":"Evidence-based medicine"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient safety"},{"type":"h","text":"Medical ethics"}]},{"heading":"Digital & Technology Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Modern clinical practice increasingly requires digital competency."},{"type":"h","text":"Essential Tools"},{"type":"h","text":"Electronic Health Records"},{"type":"h","text":"Hospital Information Systems"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital appointment systems"},{"type":"h","text":"Electronic prescription systems"},{"type":"h","text":"Microsoft Excel"},{"type":"h","text":"Google Workspace"},{"type":"h","text":"Medical databases"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital research libraries"},{"type":"h","text":"Telemedicine platforms"},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced Skills"},{"type":"h","text":"Healthcare data analysis"},{"type":"h","text":"Power BI"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical dashboards"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital patient records"},{"type":"h","text":"Research data management"},{"type":"h","text":"AI-assisted literature search"},{"type":"h","text":"AI-assisted documentation"}]},{"heading":"AI & Emerging Technology","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The Unani physician of the future will increasingly work alongside digital healthcare technologies."},{"type":"h","text":"AI Applications"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient Data"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Decision Support"},{"type":"h","text":"Relevant Medical Information"},{"type":"h","text":"Physician Evaluation"},{"type":"h","text":"Unani + Appropriate Modern Clinical Assessment"},{"type":"h","text":"Personalized Care Plan"},{"type":"h","text":"Potential applications include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical documentation assistance"},{"type":"h","text":"Medical literature discovery"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient-risk stratification"},{"type":"h","text":"Drug-information systems"},{"type":"h","text":"Health-data analysis"},{"type":"h","text":"Personalized wellness recommendations"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital follow-up systems"},{"type":"h","text":"Research analytics"},{"type":"h","text":"Telehealth support"},{"type":"p","text":"AI should remain a decision-support tool, not a substitute for professional clinical judgment."}]},{"heading":"Projects During BUMS","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Students can build a strong portfolio through academically appropriate projects."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Unani Case Documentation Portfolio"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a collection of de-identified academic case studies covering:"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient presentation"},{"type":"h","text":"History"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical findings"},{"type":"h","text":"Investigation summary"},{"type":"h","text":"Unani assessment"},{"type":"h","text":"Treatment approach"},{"type":"h","text":"Follow-up"},{"type":"p","text":"Never include personally identifiable patient information."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Unani Medicine Database"},{"type":"h","text":"Create a structured database containing:"},{"type":"h","text":"Medicine/formulation"},{"type":"h","text":"Traditional indication"},{"type":"h","text":"Ingredients"},{"type":"h","text":"Dosage information from authoritative references"},{"type":"h","text":"Contraindications/safety considerations"},{"type":"h","text":"Evidence status"},{"type":"h","text":"References"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Lifestyle & Preventive Health Program"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop a structured wellness program around:"},{"type":"h","text":"Nutrition"},{"type":"h","text":"Physical activity"},{"type":"h","text":"Sleep"},{"type":"h","text":"Stress management"},{"type":"h","text":"Preventive healthcare"},{"type":"h","text":"Lifestyle monitoring"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Digital Unani Clinic Dashboard"},{"type":"h","text":"Build a simple dashboard tracking:"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient visits"},{"type":"h","text":"Age groups"},{"type":"h","text":"Common complaints"},{"type":"h","text":"Follow-ups"},{"type":"h","text":"Appointment trends"},{"type":"h","text":"Treatment categories"},{"type":"p","text":"Use only anonymized or synthetic data."}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Internship Environments"},{"type":"h","text":"Unani hospitals"},{"type":"h","text":"Teaching hospitals"},{"type":"h","text":"Government AYUSH facilities"},{"type":"h","text":"Private Unani clinics"},{"type":"h","text":"Unani pharmacies"},{"type":"h","text":"Research institutions"},{"type":"h","text":"Public-health organizations"},{"type":"h","text":"Healthcare startups"},{"type":"h","text":"Medical research projects"},{"type":"h","text":"Wellness organizations"},{"type":"h","text":"Internship Learning Goals"},{"type":"p","text":"Rather th