el"},{"type":"h","text":"Power BI"},{"type":"h","text":"Healthcare analytics"},{"type":"h","text":"Electronic Health Records"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital health"},{"type":"h","text":"AI literacy"},{"type":"h","text":"Professional Development"},{"type":"h","text":"Medical communication"},{"type":"h","text":"Public speaking"},{"type":"h","text":"Healthcare leadership"},{"type":"h","text":"Practice management"},{"type":"h","text":"Entrepreneurship"},{"type":"p","text":"Certifications should complement the BUMS qualification rather than be treated as substitutes for professional registration or formal postgraduate training."}]},{"heading":"PG & Higher Education Options","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"After BUMS, students can consider relevant postgraduate education in Unani medicine and related fields, subject to current eligibility and institutional offerings."},{"type":"h","text":"Major Unani Specialization Areas"},{"type":"h","text":"Potential postgraduate areas include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Moalajat"},{"type":"h","text":"Ilmul Advia"},{"type":"h","text":"Tahaffuzi wa Samaji Tib"},{"type":"h","text":"Ilmul Saidla"},{"type":"h","text":"Kulliyat"},{"type":"h","text":"Mahiyatul Amraz"},{"type":"h","text":"Niswan wa Qabalat"},{"type":"h","text":"Ilmul Qabalat wa Naumaulood"},{"type":"h","text":"Ilmul Jarahat"},{"type":"h","text":"Ain, Uzn, Anf, Halaq"},{"type":"h","text":"Ilmul Samoom"},{"type":"h","text":"Other recognized Unani postgraduate specialties"},{"type":"p","text":"Exact postgraduate titles and availability should be checked against the current recognized-program framework."}]},{"heading":"Alternative Career Pathways","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A BUMS graduate does not have to remain exclusively in private clinical practice."},{"type":"h","text":"BUMS"},{"type":"h","text":"│"},{"type":"h","text":"┌───────────────────┼────────────────────┐"},{"type":"h","text":"↓ ↓ ↓"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Practice Government Researc